d wondering whose side he's on  by the way how cool is it that i could  talk about marco for the last several  chapters absolutely love having this  legend here we get a great moment where  marco seemingly sets chopper on fire  chopper is running away crying and zorro  and brook are immediately upset that  someone is attacking their teammate  understandably so it does not look good  this moment leads to confusion  on whose side marco is zorro and brooke  attack him  and i love how protective they get over  chopper but marco just flies up with his  wings and asks chopper if the flames are  hot  it is only then that chopper stops  freaking out  realizing that the fire doesn't burn the  flames are just helping with the virus  they are at the right temperature to  suppress it and many thought that  marco's flames would help with the virus  and they did  but i liked that they didn't just solve  the problem altogether  after all dr chopper needs his time to  shine since he's the one that's been set  up as the one who will create  the antibodies so the way things stand  marco held by time and chopper will fix  the problem  some nice teamwork there with help from  mink tribe dr miyagi and nurse tristan  chopper plans to go into the tower to  focus on the cure marco sees a bunch of  ice demons and decides to handle them  all at once spreading his passive flames  all over the place and we get the same  beautiful moment where like chopper  people just assume that the flames are  hot so hot until they realize that they  actually aren't instead people can feel  themselves defrosting and regain their  personalities like boss omasum as marco  points out the flames are drawing out  their  body heat but when their stamina runs  out they'll start turning into ice  demons again  queen is mad that marco is getting in  the way of his amusements and i love  seeing an angered queen  i'm ready for queen to get in a serious  fight already rather than just  messing around and not that zorro 