l  needs work and quote  that just might be the funniest moment  of the chapter for me  then jinbei says that it looks like one  of them will have to stay on this floor  suggesting that there are very powerful  opponents here  we see feline shadows suggesting it's  cat batman  of the flying six himself but for now we  move on to frankie i'm actually worried  about frankie since he has to go up  against sasaki  the guy that was suggested to be one of  the strongest of the flying six and a  potential all-star candidate  now we finally see sasuke's form which  is that of a triceratops and when i saw  this i had a nostalgic moment because it  reminded me of the land before time  but this triceratops is less friendly  and more  deadly again making me question why  denjiro left him alive so he could join  the battle later  sasaki tells frankie to give up and says  that dinosaurs are the strongest  creatures to have ever lived  and that statement makes me wanna say  that dragon should be the strongest  creatures but then maybe he's not  counting mythical beings like dragons  and phoenixes  or maybe dragons count as dinosaurs  since every time we're introduced to a  dinosaur they're classified as having a  dragon dragon fruit with a specific  dinosaur model  could just be a translation thing from  japanese to english but it still made me  stop and think  nevertheless these ancient zones are  definitely top tier  zone users in the meantime sanji is  trying to run from the ladies  and man i love sanji they don't let him  run away and we see black maria  transform into a giant spider it is an  ancient zone spider spider fruit  model and i'm gonna butcher this rosa  miguel  gravogeli i have no idea if i said that  right i'd be shocked if i did but i did  look it up  and it turns out like black maria this  spider did not go  searching for prey but waited in its  burrow for its prey  to come along and then it would trap it  kind of how sanji just walked into this  trap as well even upside down with a  spider bottom half  black maria's upper half still looks  absolutely gorgeous but i think this  scene is supposed to be scary  all of the demonic woman closing in on  the trapped sanji however for sanji he's  thinking that he has to escape  but and here's the kicker everywhere he  looks there are women  and he wonders if he is in heaven even  the woman trapping him have to wonder if  he's nuts  since that's where his mind goes in this  otherwise nightmare situation  they're even thinking yo this dude  should be freaked out right now i love  how all of the freaky looking animal  modifications have no sway on sanji  at all he can only focus on how great  this situation is because he's  surrounded by so many women and i take  my previous comment back  this is the funniest moment of the  chapter for me  seeing sanji's face like this it was  gold but it's noteworthy that  both of my most funny moments in this  chapter revolved around my boy sanji  then as expected we figured out that it  was who's who  who faced luffy and jimbei and just by  the matchups here and the fact that he  was the last to be  revealed it would seem that this cat  batman is the strongest of the six  but it's too early to say so  conclusively who's who  ended up having the very cool power of a  saber-toothed tiger i gotta admit  i didn't think it would be this cool of  a cat power but sabertooth tiger is  pretty dope  luffy has gotten away leaving jinbei to  deal with the felines  who's who calls jimbei a former warlord  but jinbei prefers to be known as the  helmsman of the straw hat pirates and  that's one of those moments that you  could easily skip past  but it's actually really cool when you  think about it i love how  proud the straw hats are to be a part of  this crew  we also have an interesting moment where  it turns out that jinbei  and who's who crossed paths before but  who's who refuses to show his face  so that jinbei could jog his memory it  may be random  but 